OL,4,BMan City owners should be forced to    
OL,5,Bsell, say rival club chiefs            
OL,6,GManchester City's owners must be       
OL,7,Gforced to sell up as punishment for    
OL,8,Gbreaking financial rules, senior       
OL,9,Gfigures at Premier League clubs have   
OL,10,Gtold BBC Sport.                        
OL,12,FThis week, the chair of the            
OL,13,FIndependent Football Regulator (IFR)   
OL,14,FDavid Kogan claimed he has the         
OL,15,F"stomach" to take action against City, 
OL,16,Fwho deny wrongdoing and have appealed. 
OL,18,FThe IFR has the power to remove        
OL,19,Fdirectors of a club if they are deemed 
OL,20,Funsuitable, and even force a sale in   
OL,21,Fthe most serious cases.                
